Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:09.85,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now let's keep moving forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:11.33,Hands Up lyrics,,0,0,0,,Always look up!
